   {
    "session_id": "16494",
    "session_title": "Empowering the Future Workforce: Innovation, Skills and Industry Collaboration",
    "session_description": "<p style=\"font-family: Hind, sans-serif;\"><span data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">This session brings together Japanese leaders in skills training and human resource development to share insights into Japan’s approaches to workforce transformation. Through innovation, industry collaboration, and skills development, the session will explore strategies to build a future-ready workforce and strengthen skills ecosystems to meet evolving industry needs.</span></p>",
