   {
    "session_id": "15771",
    "session_title": "Learning from India's Leading Skills Ecosystems",
    "session_description": "<p style=\"font-family: Hind, sans-serif;\">States across India are taking different approaches to building skills systems around their economic and workforce needs. This panel brings together Skill Development Secretaries from across the country to share what is working, the approaches that have made a difference, and the lessons emerging from implementation across states.</p>",
