   {
    "session_id": "15772",
    "session_title": "How will AI Augment Skillsets?",
    "session_description": "<p style=\"font-family: Hind, sans-serif;\">How can AI strengthen human capability and change the way work gets done? The conversation will explore how AI is reshaping roles across industries and occupations, the skills that will become more valuable, and what the workforce can prepare for as these changes unfold.</p>",
