   {
    "session_id": "17193",
    "session_title": "Academia 2030 - The Leadership Boardroom",
    "session_description": "<p>What must institutions change today to remain relevant, credible and future-ready in 2030?</p>\n<p>Curated by Ripples Learning &amp; Research and CHRMP, this exclusive Boardroom convenes 15 senior academic leaders to examine the fundamental choices shaping higher education.</p>\n<p>From curriculum agility and AI-enabled pedagogy to capability-based assessment, research relevance and faculty development, the dialogue explores what institutions must preserve, redesign or stop doing.</p>\n<p>Drawing on institutional practices and three connected survey rounds, leaders will identify actionable priorities and 90–180-day pilots.&nbsp;Insights will inform the Karnataka Future-Ready Institutions Report 2026, connecting academic perspectives, industry expectations and institutional transformation.</p>",
    "session_type": 1,
    "start_timestamp": "2026-11-05 09:00:00",
    "end_timestamp": "2026-11-05 10:30:00",
    "session_location": "",
    "session_colour": "#FFECD3",
