   {
    "session_id": "15773",
    "session_title": "Turning Skills into Global Careers",
    "session_description": "<p style=\"font-family: Hind, sans-serif;\">What turns a good skill into a career that can travel across borders? This session will explore recognised qualifications, international standards, language skills and workplace readiness, alongside the partnerships and mobility support needed to connect talent with overseas opportunities.</p>",
