   {
    "session_id": "15774",
    "session_title": "Traditional Skills in Karnataka: Can Heritage Become the Next Generation of Enterprise?",
    "session_description": "<p style=\"font-family: Hind, sans-serif;\">Karnataka has a rich base of traditional skills, but how can these skills create viable opportunities for a new generation? This conversation will explore how training, entrepreneurship, better markets and changing consumer demand can help turn traditional knowledge into modern livelihoods and enterprises.&nbsp;</p>",
