    "session_title": "From Knowledge to Capability: Integrating Employability into Technical Education for Workforce 2030",
    "session_description": "<p style=\"font-family: Hind, sans-serif;\">This roundtable will bring together industry leaders, senior representatives from universities, engineering and technology colleges, technical training institutions, and skills development organisations to explore how technical education can better respond to workforce needs. The discussion will focus on making application-based technical skills aspirational, strengthening industry collaboration, attracting and retaining learners in technical education, and supporting their transition from trainees to skilled professionals. It will also examine how institutions and employers can connect technical programs with practical training, apprenticeships, internships, entrepreneurship and continuous upskilling to improve employability and career progression.</p>",
